```console
$ scrapmf scrape --help
Scrape a URL using the configured backend

Usage: scrapmf scrape [OPTIONS] <URL>

Arguments:
  <URL>  URL to scrape

Options:
  -o, --output <PATH>                   Output directory (overrides site/global output)
  -v, --verbose...                      Increase verbosity (-v, -vv)
      --preset <NAME>                   Preset from presets/ (forces a site config)
      --cookies <FILE>                  Cookies file (Netscape cookies.txt)
      --cookies-from-browser <BROWSER>  Cookies from browser (e.g. firefox, brave, chrome)
      --dry-run                         Do not download, only print what would be done
      --no-archive                      Disable the download archive (dedup) for this run
      --profile-pic-only                Threads only: download profile picture instead of posts
  -h, --help                            Print help

Examples:
  scrapmf scrape https://www.instagram.com/user/ --dry-run
  scrapmf scrape https://www.tiktok.com/@user -o ~/scrapmf --cookies-from-browser brave
  scrapmf scrape URL --no-archive

```
